  "problem": "Consider the equation $\\operatorname{sin}⁡(4x-\\frac{\\pi }{4})=-\\frac{1}{2}$ for $0\\le x<\\pi .$ If the solutions ${x}_{1},{x}_{2},{x}_{3},{x}_{4}$ are written in **ascending order**, what are their values? Express your answers in terms of $\\pi .$\n\n${x}_{1}=${{field-1}}$,\\,$\n${x}_{2}=${{field-2}}$,\\,$\n${x}_{3}=${{field-3}}$,\\,$\n${x}_{4}=${{field-4}}",
